        "synopsis": "A mysterious explosion on Futagami Island begins a new chapter in the Dangaioh mythos! Led by the evil Professor Katou, a band of warriors calling themselves the \"Tartarus Knights\" have begun their campaign to lay waste to the world by way of a small research station on Futagami Island. Katou's victory seems almost certain until he encounters an advanced fortress guarding the island. From it, a group of three humanoid robots are launched—Dangaioh!\n\n(Source: AniDB)",
        "background": "Initially planned to have an episode length of 26 episodes, production was cancelled after episode 13, due to the poor reception of the series.",
